/**
 * Database type definitions for the Supabase adapter.
 *
 * These types mirror the SQL schema in `supabase/migrations/`. They are
 * deliberately hand-written (not generated by `supabase gen types`) so
 * the desktop app can be developed independently of a live Supabase project.
 * When the project is provisioned, run `supabase gen types --lang=ts` and
 * replace this file with the generated output for full type safety.
 */

